    {
      "name": "benign/ansible-runs-shell-module",
      "label": "benign",
      "data_type": 3000,
      "fields": {
        "exe": "/bin/sh",
        "cmdline": "sh -c /usr/bin/python3 /home/deploy/.ansible/tmp/ansible-tmp-1690000000/AnsiballZ_setup.py",
        "parent_exe": "/usr/bin/sshd",
        "pid": "5001",
        "ppid": "2100",
        "username": "deploy"
      },
      "note": "配置管理执行远程模块。形态上就是「远程连接派生 shell 跑 python」，与攻击极像，但它是常态运维——把它调成告警会让值班每次发布都被打扰"
    },
    {
      "name": "benign/curl-download-to-file",
      "label": "benign",
      "data_type": 3000,
      "fields": {
        "exe": "/usr/bin/curl",
        "cmdline": "curl -sSL https://mirrors.internal/repo/pkg.tar.gz -o /tmp/pkg.tar.gz",
        "pid": "5002",
        "ppid": "2100",
        "username": "deploy"
      },
      "note": "只下载不执行。与 curl|bash 只差一个管道，规则若按「curl 出现即告警」写就会在这里误报"
    },
    {
