      "name": "benign/logrotate-postrotate",
      "label": "benign",
      "data_type": 3000,
      "fields": {
        "exe": "/bin/sh",
        "cmdline": "sh -c /usr/bin/systemctl reload nginx",
        "parent_exe": "/usr/sbin/logrotate",
        "pid": "5006",
        "ppid": "2200",
        "username": "root"
      },
      "note": "日志轮转的 postrotate 钩子。root 身份派生 shell 执行命令，形态与攻击一致，靠父进程才能区分"
